      <description>&lt;p&gt;Olá, tudo bem?!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com previsão de lançamento para dezembro de 2019, o PHP 7.4 está com novidades muito legais e que temos que estar antenados e acompanhando essa evolução, separei abaixo algumas novas funcionalidades que acredito serem bem bacanas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;preloading-rfc&#34;&gt;Preloading &lt;a href=&#34;https://wiki.php.net/rfc/preloa&#34;&gt;rfc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preloading é uma adição incrível ao core do PHP, o que pode resultar em uma melhora em seu desempenho.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atualmente os arquivos PHP são carregados e recompilados a cada requisição.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Refactoring – Replace temp with query</title>
      <link>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/refactoring-replace-temp-with-query/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 17 Sep 2018 12:37:37 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/refactoring-replace-temp-with-query/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Olá, tubo bem?!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frequentemente vemos o uso de variáveis locais realizarem operações e/ou ações.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&#34;code-block&#34; data-lang=&#34;php&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;code-block-bar&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;code-block-dots&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-php&#34; data-lang=&#34;php&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;php&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$basePrice&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;quantity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;itemPrice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$basePrice&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;1000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;){&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$basePrice&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;0.95&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$basePrice&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;0.98&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;por-que-devemos-refatorar&#34;&gt;Por que devemos refatorar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abrirá portas para utilizarmos o &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.diegobrocanelli.com.br/refactoring/refactoring-extract-method/&#34;&gt;Extract Methods&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Podemos reutilizar a mesma expressão em outras partes do sistema.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitamos as modificações/implementações de regras de negócio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;solução-para-o-problema&#34;&gt;Solução para o problema!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Devemos extrair a lógica responsável por realizar a operação e limpamos o processo de execução do código.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Modularizando sua aplicação Laravel</title>
      <link>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/laravel-module/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Sep 2018 13:34:32 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/laravel-module/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Olá, tudo bem?!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Criar aplicações reutilizáveis, manuteníveis, de fácil compreensão pelos membros do time é o desafio do dia a dia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sem sombra de dúvidas é o correto e devemos seguir esta linha de pensamento, pois assim temos uma aplicação saudável, facilitando novas implementações.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O Laravel é um grande framework, onde vem crescendo cada vez mais ao longo dos anos, em minhas pesquisas e estudos encontrei uma maneira de construir aplicações de forma modular no framework, e irei compartilhar com vocês os resultados dos estudos.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Refactoring – Extract Method</title>
      <link>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/refactoring-extract-method/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Aug 2018 16:17:28 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://diegobrocanelli.com.br/posts/refactoring-extract-method/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Olá, tudo bem?!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Você já deve ter esbarrado ou feito manutenção em códigos que o método tem muitas ações, como bem sabemos isso é muito ruim, pois aumenta a complexidade da leitura, manutenção, acoplamento e dificulta seu reuso. Abaixo podemos observar um exemplo:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&#34;code-block&#34; data-lang=&#34;php&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;code-block-bar&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;code-block-dots&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-php&#34; data-lang=&#34;php&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;php&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;printOwing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;printBanner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;//print details
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;name:  &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;amount &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;getOutstanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;());&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;por-que-refatorar&#34;&gt;Por que refatorar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quanto mais linhas um método tiver, mais difícil será localizar bugs, prestar manutenção, implementar novas funcionalidades e reutilizar a solução.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
